# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Use the [`Neat` class](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) to analyze the noise impact on an Estimator workload.\n"
"- Review detailed [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) tutorial.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"- Usa la [classe `Neat`](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) per analizzare l'impatto del rumore su un carico di lavoro Estimator.\n"
"- Consulta gli esempi dettagliati di [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Consulta gli esempi dettagliati di [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Leggi [Migrazione alle primitive V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Esercitati con le primitive seguendo la [lezione sulle funzioni di costo](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Impara come eseguire il transpiling localmente nella sezione [Transpile](/guides/transpile).\n"
"- Prova il tutorial [Confronta le impostazioni del transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
